-256 pre-image backups.</p><div class=\"rise-block mt-7 max-w-xl\" style=\"--d:620ms\"><div class=\"mb-2 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-1.5 text-[11px] font-medium text-muted-foreground\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"rounded-md px-2 py-0.5 transition-colors bg-brand text-brand-foreground font-semibold\">npm</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"rounded-md px-2 py-0.5 transition-colors bg-muted/50 text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground\">curl (macOS/Linux)</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"rounded-md px-2 py-0.5 transition-colors bg-muted/50 text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground\">PowerShell (Windows)</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"rounded-md px-2 py-0.5 transition-colors bg-muted/50 text-muted-foreground hover:text-foreground\">npx</button></div><div class=\"flex items-stretch overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-[oklch(0.16_0.01_163)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 border-r border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] px-3 font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-brand\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-terminal h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 19h8\"></path><path d=\"m4 17 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg>npm</span><code class=\"min-w-0 flex-1 overflow-x-auto whitespace-nowrap no-scrollbar px-3.5 py-2.5 font-mono text-[11.5px] sm:text-[12.5px] text-[oklch(0.93_0.01_163)]\" title=\"npm install -g litespm\">npm install -g litespm</code><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy install command\" class=\"shrink-0 border-l border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] px-3.5 text-[11.5px] font-medium text-white/70 transition-colors hover:bg-brand/15 hover:text-brand\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" str