v><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-3 bg-white/[0.02] px-4 py-2 font-mono text-[10.5px] text-white/45\"><span class=\"truncate\">Auto-detect agents, sync 69K+ catalog &amp; launch Manager</span><span class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1.5 text-emerald-400/90 font-medium\"><span class=\"h-1.5 w-1.5 animate-pulse rounded-full bg-emerald-400 shadow-[0_0_6px_rgba(52,211,153,0.8)]\"></span>52<!-- --> hosts supported</span></div></div><p class=\"px-4 py-2 text-[11px] text-muted-foreground\">Illustrated terminal walkthrough; output and paths vary by version and machine.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"border-b border-border/60 bg-muted/20 py-3.5\" aria-label=\"Security and safety guarantees\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 px-4 text-[12px] sm:px-6\"><a href=\"/docs/install-flow\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-brand\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-eye h-4 w-4 text-brand\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M2.062 12.348a1 1 0 0 1 0-.696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1 19.876 0 1 1 0 0 1 0 .696 10.75 10.75 0 0 1-19.876 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg><span class=\"font-medium text-foreground\">Preview before write</span><span class=\"hidden text-muted-foreground/80 md:inline\">— Review the proposed changes</span></a><a href=\"/docs/security\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-brand\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check h-4 w-4 text-brand\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span class=\"font-medium text-foreground\">Automatic CAS backup</span><span class=\"hidden text-muted-foreground/80 md:inline\">— Pre-image digest verification</span></a><a href=\"/docs/install-flow\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-brand\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-rotate-ccw h-4 w-4 text-brand\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8\"></path><path d=\"M3 3v5h5\"></path></svg><span class=\"font-medium text-foreground\">Backup restoration</span><span class=\"hidden text-muted-foreground/80 md:inline\">— Review conflicts before restoring</span></a><a href=\"/docs/security\" class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-brand\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check h-4 w-4 text-brand\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span class=\"font-medium text-foreground\">Sigstore-signed releases</span><span class=\"hidden text-muted-foreground/80 md:inline\">— Keyless GitHub OIDC provenance</span></a></div></section><section class=\"border-b border-border/60 bg-card/40 py-5\" aria-label=\"Supported agents\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-col gap-3 px-4 sm:flex-row sm:items