nter rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-foreground/90\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80\"></span>VS Code</li><li class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-foreground/90\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80\"></span>Antigravity</li><li class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-foreground/90\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80\"></span>Pi</li><li class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-foreground/90\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80\"></span>Grok Build</li><li class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-foreground/90\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80\"></span>Kiro CLI</li><li class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-foreground/90\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80\"></span>Amp</li><li class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-foreground/90\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80\"></span>Roo Code</li><li class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-foreground/90\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80\"></span>Kilo Code</li><li class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-foreground/90\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80\"></span>Junie</li><li class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-foreground/90\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80\"></span>Augment</li><li class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-foreground/90\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80\"></span>Qwen Code</li><li class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-foreground/90\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80\"></span>Crush</li><li class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-foreground/90\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80\"></span>Droid</li><li class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-foreground/90\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80\"></span>Tabnine CLI</li><li class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-foreground/90\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80\"></span>Devin</li><li class=\"inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-foreground/90\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80\"></span>OpenHands</li><li aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"marquee-dup inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-foreground/90\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80\"></span>Claude Code</li><li aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"marquee-dup inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-foreground/90\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80\"></span>Cursor</li><li aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"marquee-dup inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-foreground/90\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80\"></span>GitHub Copilot</li><li aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"marquee-dup inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-foreground/90\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80\"></span>OpenAI Codex</li><li aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"marquee-dup inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-foreground/90\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80\"></span>Gemini CLI</li><li aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"marquee-dup inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-foreground/90\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80\"></span>Cline</li><li aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"marquee-dup inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-foreground/90\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80\"></span>OpenCode</li><li aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"marquee-dup inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-foreground/90\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80\"></span>Zed</li><li aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"marquee-dup inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-foreground/90\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80\"></span>VS Code</li><li aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"marquee-dup inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-foreground/90\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80\"></span>Antigravity</li><li aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"marquee-dup inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-foreground/90\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80\"></span>Pi</li><li aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"marquee-dup inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-foreground/90\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80\"></span>Grok Build</li><li aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"marquee-dup inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-foreground/90\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80\"></span>Kiro CLI</li><li aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"marquee-dup inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-foreground/90\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80\"></span>Amp</li><li aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"marquee-dup inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-foreground/90\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80\"></span>Roo Code</li><li aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"marquee-dup inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-foreground/90\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80\"></span>Kilo Code</li><li aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"marquee-dup inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-foreground/90\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80\"></span>Junie</li><li aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"marquee-dup inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-foreground/90\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80\"></span>Augment</li><li aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"marquee-dup inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-foreground/90\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80\"></span>Qwen Code</li><li aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"marquee-dup inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-foreground/90\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80\"></span>Crush</li><li aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"marquee-dup inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-foreground/90\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80\"></span>Droid</li><li aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"marquee-dup inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-foreground/90\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80\"></span>Tabnine CLI</li><li aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"marquee-dup inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-foreground/90\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80\"></span>Devin</li><li aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"marquee-dup inline-flex shrink-0 items-center rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-card px-2.5 py-1 text-xs text-foreground/90\"><span class=\"mr-1.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500/80\"></span>OpenHands</li></ul></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"shrink-0 text-left text-[12px] font-semibold text-brand hover:underline\">All <!-- -->52<!-- --> agents →</button></div></section><section class=\"border-b border-border/60 bg-card/20 py-16 sm:py-20\" aria-labelledby=\"why-title\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"max-w-[70ch]\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[11.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-brand\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z\"></path><path d=\"M20 3v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 5h-4\"></path><path d=\"M4 17v2\"></path><path d=\"M5 18H3\"></path></svg> Why LiteSPM?</p><h2 id=\"why-title\" class=\"mt-2 text-[clamp(1.9rem,3.8vw,2.7rem)] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.035em]\">Every agent has its own config. <br class=\"hidden sm:inline\"/><span class=\"text-brand\">One workflow across supported agents.</span></h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Every agent keeps its own configuration file in its own format, and every server ships its own setup steps. LiteSPM understands supported host formats, prepares the appropriate entry, keeps backups and tracks managed changes.</p></div><div class=\"mt-10 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border/70 bg-card p-5 transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-brand/40 hover:shadow-[0_12px_28px_-10px_rgba(16,185,129,0.12)]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><div class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-soft text-brand font-mono text-[13px] font-bold\">/m</div><h3 class=\"mt-4 text-[16px] font-semibold tracking-tight\">Cross-agent</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\"><code class=\"rounded bg-muted/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-brand text-[12px]\">litespm setup</code> connects supported agents. Selected hosts offer marketplace integrations; see the compatibility matrix. Or run <code class=\"rounded bg-muted/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-brand text-[12px]\">litespm marketplace</code> in any terminal.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border/70 bg-card p-5 transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-brand/40 hover:shadow-[0_12px_28px_-10px_rgba(16,185,129,0.12)]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><div class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-soft text-brand\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-circle-check h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 text-[16px] font-semibold tracking-tight\">Reviewable</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\"><code class=\"rounded bg-muted/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-brand text-[12px]\">npm install -g litespm</code>, then use the wizard to choose targets. Preview an installation plan with --dry-run before applying changes.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border/70 bg-card p-5 transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-brand/40 hover:shadow-[0_12px_28px_-10px_rgba(16,185,129,0.12)]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><div class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-soft text-brand\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 text-[16px] font-semibold tracking-tight\">Reversible</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">LiteSPM backs up your agent&#x27;s configuration before writing any change. To roll back, <code class=\"rounded bg-muted/60 px-1 py-0.5 font-mono text-brand text-[11.5px]\">litespm restore &lt;installId&gt;</code> restores an eligible backup. Use install remove for managed removal; inspect conflict warnings.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border/70 bg-card p-5 transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:border-brand/40 hover:shadow-[0_12px_28px_-10px_rgba(16,185,129,0.12)]\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(16px)\"><div class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-soft text-brand\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-terminal h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 19h8\"></path><path d=\"m4 17 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 text-[16px] font-semibold tracking-tight\">Local-first</h3><p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Manage capabilities on your machine. Run <code class=\"rounded bg-muted/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-brand text-[12px]\">litespm</code> for the interactive wizard. Scripting it? Use flags such as <code class=\"font-mono text-[11.5px]\">--agent</code> and <code class=\"font-mono text-[11.5px]\">--scope</code>.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"border-b border-border/60 py-14\" aria-labelledby=\"workflow-example-title\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-center gap-8 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div><p class=\"text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-brand\">A practical example</p><h2 id=\"workflow-example-title\" class=\"mt-2 text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight\">One package. Two agents. One plan.</h2><p class=\"mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Use Claude Code and Codex? Choose both compatible hosts, preview the GitHub MCP server install, review its credentials and approve the changes. Remove managed entries when you no longer need them.</p><div class=\"mt-5\"><div class=\"flex items-stretch overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-[oklch(0.16_0.01_163)]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 border-r border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] px-3 font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-brand\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-terminal h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 19h8\"></path><path d=\"m4 17 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg>Preview</span><code class=\"min-w-0 flex-1 overflow-x-auto whitespace-nowrap no-scrollbar px-3.5 py-2.5 font-mono text-[11.5px] sm:text-[12.5px] text-[oklch(0.93_0.01_163)]\" title=\"litespm install github --agent claude-code --agent codex --dry-run\">litespm install github --agent claude-code --agent codex --dry-run</code><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy install command\" class=\"shrink-0 border-l border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] px-3.5 text-[11.5px] font-medium text-white/70 transition-colors hover:bg-brand/15 hover:text-brand\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-copy h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"14\" x=\"8\" y=\"8\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></div></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Requires connected hosts and a synced catalog. Authentication is publisher-specific.</p></div><figure class=\"overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/70 bg-card\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\" srcSet=\"/demo/litespm-workflow.png\"/><img src=\"/demo/litespm-workflow.gif\" alt=\"Illustrated workflow: discover a package, choose hosts, preview changes, approve and remove managed entries.\" width=\"960\" height=\"480\" loading=\"lazy\" class=\"h-auto w-full\"/></picture><figcaption class=\"p-3 text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Illustrated workflow; not a live terminal recording.</figcaption></figure></div></section><section class=\"border-b border-border/60 py-14\" aria-labelledby=\"inagent-title\"><div class=\"mx-auto grid max-w-6xl gap-8 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.1fr] lg:items-center\"><div><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-brand\">Without leaving your agent</p><h2 id=\"inagent-title\" class=\"mt-1.5 text-[clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.2rem)] font-semibold leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em]\">The marketplace, one command away</h2><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-[56ch] text-[14px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\"><code class=\"rounded bg-muted/60 px-1.5 py-0.5 font-mono text-[12px] text-brand\">litespm setup</code> <!-- -->connects a supported agent and adds an in-agent command where implemented. Where the agent can draw a view you get an interactive popup that spends no model turn; some other integrations provide a prompt command and the agent&#x27;s own model drives LiteSPM. It never approves an install for you.</p><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><a href=\"/docs/in-agent-marketplace\" data-slot=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive border bg-background shadow-xs hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground dark:bg-input/30 dark:border-input dark:hover:bg-input/52 h-9 px-4 py-2 has-[&gt;svg]:px-3 rounded-xl\">How it works</a><a href=\"/docs/agent-compatibility\" data-slot=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive hover:bg-accent dark:hover:bg-accent/52 h-9 px-4 py-2 has-[&gt;svg]:px-3 rounded-xl text-brand hover:text-brand\">Agent compatibility <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></div><p class=\"mt-3 text-[11.5px] text-muted-foreground\">Included in v<!-- -->0.6.0<!-- --> (latest release).</p></div><ul class=\"grid gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2\" aria-label=\"Agents with an interactive popup\"><li class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/70 bg-card p-3.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-2\"><span class=\"text-[13.5px] font-semibold\">Pi</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-brand/30 bg-brand-soft px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-brand\">Popup</span></div><p class=\"mt-1.5 font-mono text-[11.5px] text-foreground/90\">/marketplace</p></li><li class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/70 bg-card p-3.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-2\"><span class=\"text-[13.5px] font-semibold\">OpenCode</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-brand/30 bg-brand-soft px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-brand\">Popup</span></div><p class=\"mt-1.5 font-mono text-[11.5px] text-foreground/90\">/litespm-marketplace</p></li><li class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/70 bg-card p-3.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-2\"><span class=\"text-[13.5px] font-semibold\">Claude Code</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-brand/30 bg-brand-soft px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-brand\">Popup</span></div><p class=\"mt-1.5 font-mono text-[11.5px] text-foreground/90\">/litespm-marketplace</p></li><li class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/70 bg-card p-3.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-2\"><span class=\"text-[13.5px] font-semibold\">GitHub Copilot CLI</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-brand/30 bg-brand-soft px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-brand\">Popup</span></div><p class=\"mt-1.5 font-mono text-[11.5px] text-foreground/90\">/litespm-marketplace</p></li><li class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/70 bg-card p-3.5\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-2\"><span class=\"text-[13.5px] font-semibold\">Amp</span><span class=\"rounded-full border border-brand/30 bg-brand-soft px-2 py-0.5 text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.08em] text-brand\">Popup</span></div><p class=\"mt-1.5 font-mono text-[11.5px] text-foreground/90\">Command palette → “LiteSPM: Marketplace”</p></li><li class=\"rounded-xl border border-dashed border-border/70 bg-card/50 p-3.5 text-[12.5px] text-muted-foreground\">+ prompt commands for Gemini CLI, Qwen Code, Kiro CLI, Cursor, Codex, Cline and more.</li></ul></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6\" aria-labelledby=\"explore-title\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-3\"><div><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-brand\">One catalog, five ways in</p><h2 id=\"explore-title\" class=\"mt-1 text-[26px] font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-[30px]\">Explore the catalog</h2><p class=\"mt-1 max-w-[64ch] text-[13px] text-muted-foreground\">Pick a view: a transparent score, a task, a curated bundle, or what people open on this deployment or labeled upstream metrics. Explore each listing to see its installation options.</p></div><button data-slot=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 shrink-0 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive border bg-background shadow-xs hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground dark:bg-input/30 dark:border-input dark:hover:bg-input/52 h-9 px-4 py-2 has-[&gt;svg]:px-3 rounded-xl\">Open full marketplace <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></button></div><div role=\"tablist\" aria-label=\"Explore views\" class=\"mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-2 border-b border-border/60 pb-3\"><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"true\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 text-[13px] font-medium transition-colors bg-brand-soft text-brand\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-trophy h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 14.66v1.626a2 2 0 0 1-.976 1.696A5 5 0 0 0 7 21.978\"></path><path d=\"M14 14.66v1.626a2 2 0 0 0 .976 1.696A5 5 0 0 1 17 21.978\"></path><path d=\"M18 9h1.5a1 1 0 0 0 0-5H18\"></path><path d=\"M4 22h16\"></path><path d=\"M6 9a6 6 0 0 0 12 0V3a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H7a1 1 0 0 0-1 1z\"></path><path d=\"M6 9H4.5a1 1 0 0 1 0-5H6\"></path></svg>Ranked</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 text-[13px] font-medium transition-colors text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted/50 hover:text-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-sparkles h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9.937 15.5A2 2 0 0 0 8.5 14.063l-6.135-1.582a.5.5 0 0 1 0-.962L8.5 9.936A2 2 0 0 0 9.937 8.5l1.582-6.135a.5.5 0 0 1 .963 0L14.063 8.5A2 2 0 0 0 15.5 9.937l6.135 1.581a.5.5 0 0 1 0 .964L15.5 14.063a2 2 0 0 0-1.437 1.437l-1.582 6.135a.5.5 0 0 1-.963 0z\"></path><path d=\"M20 3v4\"></path><path d=\"M22 5h-4\"></path><path d=\"M4 17v2\"></path><path d=\"M5 18H3\"></path></svg>By goal</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 text-[13px] font-medium transition-colors text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted/50 hover:text-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-package h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11 21.73a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73z\"></path><path d=\"M12 22V12\"></path><polyline points=\"3.29 7 12 12 20.71 7\"></polyline><path d=\"m7.5 4.27 9 5.15\"></path></svg>Bundles</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 text-[13px] font-medium transition-colors text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted/50 hover:text-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-bookmark h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z\"></path></svg>Featured</button><button type=\"button\" role=\"tab\" aria-selected=\"false\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-lg px-3 py-1.5 text-[13px] font-medium transition-colors text-muted-foreground hover:bg-muted/50 hover:text-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-flame h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M8.5 14.5A2.5 2.5 0 0 0 11 12c0-1.38-.5-2-1-3-1.072-2.143-.224-4.054 2-6 .5 2.5 2 4.9 4 6.5 2 1.6 3 3.5 3 5.5a7 7 0 1 1-14 0c0-1.153.433-2.294 1-3a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 2.5 2.5z\"></path></svg>Trending</button></div><div role=\"tabpanel\" class=\"mt-6\"><div><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-2\"><p class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[12px] text-muted-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-trophy h-3.5 w-3.5 text-brand\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M10 14.66v1.626a2 2 0 0 1-.976 1.696A5 5 0 0 0 7 21.978\"></path><path d=\"M14 14.66v1.626a2 2 0 0 0 .976 1.696A5 5 0 0 1 17 21.978\"></path><path d=\"M18 9h1.5a1 1 0 0 0 0-5H18\"></path><path d=\"M4 22h16\"></path><path d=\"M6 9a6 6 0 0 0 12 0V3a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H7a1 1 0 0 0-1 1z\"></path><path d=\"M6 9H4.5a1 1 0 0 1 0-5H6\"></path></svg> Ranked by the LiteSPM score<span class=\"group relative inline-flex\" tabindex=\"0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-info h-3.5 w-3.5 cursor-help text-muted-foreground/60\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 16v-4\"></path><path d=\"M12 8h.01\"></path></svg><span role=\"tooltip\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute bottom-full left-1/2 z-50 mb-2 hidden w-[min(340px,85vw)] -translate-x-1/2 rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-popover p-3 text-left text-[11.5px] leading-relaxed text-popover-foreground shadow-xl group-hover:block group-focus:block\">LiteSPM Score (0–100) — an editorial reputation model: recognition of the tool in the agent ecosystem (0–35 — official MCP references, top-vendor servers, Anthropic&#x27;s official skills), vendor authority — first-party publishers like Microsoft, Anthropic or Supabase (0–18), proven installability — tested beats verified beats claimed (0–15), record completeness (0–12), description substance (0–5), and GitHub stars when a source publishes them (0–15, log scale). Exactly sums to 100. Spam and parse-artifact records are penalized. Result lists put installable listings first, then discovery-only ones, each in score order.<span class=\"mt-1.5 block font-medium text-foreground\">Full method: Docs, “How we rank and label” (/docs/methodology).</span></span></span></p><button type=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[12.5px] font-medium text-brand hover:underline\">Full ranking <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"mt-4 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border/60 p-6\"><div class=\"h-5 w-40 animate-pulse rounded bg-muted/40\"></div><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-2.5\"><div class=\"h-10 animate-pulse rounded-lg bg-muted/30\"></div><div class=\"h-10 animate-pulse rounded-lg bg-muted/30\"></div><div class=\"h-10 animate-pulse rounded-lg bg-muted/30\"></div><div class=\"h-10 animate-pulse rounded-lg bg-muted/30\"></div><div class=\"h-10 animate-pulse rounded-lg bg-muted/30\"></div><div class=\"h-10 animate-pulse rounded-lg bg-muted/30\"></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-2xl border border-border/60 p-6\"><div class=\"h-5 w-40 animate-pulse rounded bg-muted/40\"></div><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-2.5\"><div class=\"h-10 animate-pulse rounded-lg bg-muted/30\"></div><div class=\"h-10 animate-pulse rounded-lg bg-muted/30\"></div><div class=\"h-10 animate-pulse rounded-lg bg-muted/30\"></div><div class=\"h-10 animate-pulse rounded-lg bg-muted/30\"></div><div class=\"h-10 animate-pulse rounded-lg bg-muted/30\"></div><div class=\"h-10 animate-pulse rounded-lg bg-muted/30\"></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6\" aria-labelledby=\"how-title\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-end justify-between gap-4\"><div class=\"min-w-0\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-brand\">How it works</p><h2 class=\"mt-1.5 text-[24px] font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-[28px]\"><span id=\"how-title\">Plan. Preview. Approve. Undo.</span></h2><p class=\"mt-1.5 max-w-[62ch] text-[13.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Inspect a plan, approve agent-originated installs, and keep a record of managed configuration changes.</p></div></div><div class=\"mt-8 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3\"><div class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-border/70 bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-brand/40\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(10px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-soft text-brand\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21 21-4.34-4.34\"></path><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle></svg></span><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold text-muted-foreground\">0<!-- -->1</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 text-[16px] font-semibold tracking-tight\">Find it once</h3><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Search the listings — MCP servers, skills and plugins — with publisher, source and installability stated up front.</p></div><div class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-border/70 bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-brand/40\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(10px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-soft text-brand\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-cable h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M17 21v-2a1 1 0 0 1-1-1v-1a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v1a1 1 0 0 1-1 1\"></path><path d=\"M19 15V6.5a1 1 0 0 0-7 0v11a1 1 0 0 1-7 0V9\"></path><path d=\"M21 21v-2h-4\"></path><path d=\"M3 5h4V3\"></path><path d=\"M7 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v1a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H4a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1V3\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold text-muted-foreground\">0<!-- -->2</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 text-[16px] font-semibold tracking-tight\">Choose your agents</h3><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Target compatible hosts explicitly and preview the plan before applying it.</p></div><div class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-border/70 bg-card p-5 transition-colors hover:border-brand/40\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(10px)\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\"><span class=\"flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-brand-soft text-brand\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-undo2 lucide-undo-2 h-5 w-5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M9 14 4 9l5-5\"></path><path d=\"M4 9h10.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1 5.5 5.5a5.5 5.5 0 0 1-5.5 5.5H11\"></path></svg></span><span class=\"font-mono text-[11px] font-semibold text-muted-foreground\">0<!-- -->3</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-4 text-[16px] font-semibold tracking-tight\">Remove or restore</h3><p class=\"mt-1.5 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Managed changes are recorded in a ledger. Remove tracked entries or restore an eligible backup; review conflicts and later edits.</p></div></div></section><section class=\"border-t border-border/60 bg-card/25 py-14 sm:py-16\" aria-labelledby=\"why-more-title\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-4xl px-4 sm:px-6\"><p class=\"text-center text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-brand\">Why LiteSPM</p><h2 id=\"why-more-title\" class=\"mt-2 text-center text-[clamp(1.6rem,3vw,2.1rem)] font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em]\">More to know</h2><div class=\"mt-8 space-y-3\"><details class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-border/70 bg-card p-5 transition-all hover:border-brand/35\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold text-[14.5px] [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><span>52<!-- --> hosts. One command.</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-open:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"faq-answer\"><div class=\"pt-3\"><p class=\"text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Supported host adapters share a management workflow. Pick yours to see the exact config file LiteSPM writes.</p><div class=\"mt-4 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2\"><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Configure Cursor with command host setup cursor\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl border border-border/70 px-3.5 py-2.5 text-left text-[13px] font-medium transition-colors hover:border-brand/40\">Cursor<code class=\"font-mono text-[10.5px] text-brand/80\">host setup <!-- -->cursor</code></button><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Configure GitHub Copilot with command host setup github-copilot\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl border border-border/70 px-3.5 py-2.5 text-left text-[13px] font-medium transition-colors hover:border-brand/40\">GitHub Copilot<code class=\"font-mono text-[10.5px] text-brand/80\">host setup <!-- -->github-copilot</code></button><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Configure Cline with command host setup cline\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl border border-border/70 px-3.5 py-2.5 text-left text-[13px] font-medium transition-colors hover:border-brand/40\">Cline<code class=\"font-mono text-[10.5px] text-brand/80\">host setup <!-- -->cline</code></button><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Configure Claude Code with command host setup claude-code\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl border border-border/70 px-3.5 py-2.5 text-left text-[13px] font-medium transition-colors hover:border-brand/40\">Claude Code<code class=\"font-mono text-[10.5px] text-brand/80\">host setup <!-- -->claude-code</code></button><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Configure OpenAI Codex with command host setup codex\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl border border-border/70 px-3.5 py-2.5 text-left text-[13px] font-medium transition-colors hover:border-brand/40\">OpenAI Codex<code class=\"font-mono text-[10.5px] text-brand/80\">host setup <!-- -->codex</code></button><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Configure Gemini CLI with command host setup gemini-cli\" class=\"flex items-center justify-between rounded-xl border border-border/70 px-3.5 py-2.5 text-left text-[13px] font-medium transition-colors hover:border-brand/40\">Gemini CLI<code class=\"font-mono text-[10.5px] text-brand/80\">host setup <!-- -->gemini-cli</code></button></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Browse all 52 supported agent hosts\" class=\"mt-4 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[12.5px] font-medium text-brand hover:underline\">Browse all <!-- -->52<!-- --> agents <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></button></div></div></details><details class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-border/70 bg-card p-5 transition-all hover:border-brand/35\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold text-[14.5px] [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><span>Your machine, your keys.</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-open:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"faq-answer\"><div class=\"mt-3 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/60 p-3.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield-check h-4 w-4 text-brand\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] font-semibold\">No account, no proxy</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Tokens stay in the OS vault or as environment references. The CLI keeps managed credentials local; network services have separate data flows.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/60 p-3.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-rotate-ccw h-4 w-4 text-brand\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 12a9 9 0 1 0 9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8\"></path><path d=\"M3 3v5h5\"></path></svg><p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] font-semibold\">Byte-exact restore</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Restore an eligible recorded backup; review conflicts and later edits before proceeding.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/60 p-3.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-bookmark h-4 w-4 text-brand\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z\"></path></svg><p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] font-semibold\">Ledger ownership</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">install remove strips only the nodes LiteSPM wrote. Your edits stay.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/60 p-3.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-badge-check h-4 w-4 text-brand\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3.85 8.62a4 4 0 0 1 4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 6.74 0 4 4 0 0 1 4.78 4.78 4 4 0 0 1 0 6.74 4 4 0 0 1-4.77 4.78 4 4 0 0 1-6.75 0 4 4 0 0 1-4.78-4.77 4 4 0 0 1 0-6.76Z\"></path><path d=\"m9 12 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><p class=\"mt-2 text-[13px] font-semibold\">Stated provenance</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Installable means the listing has supported install metadata, not an independent security audit.</p></div></div></div></details><details class=\"group rounded-2xl border border-border/70 bg-card p-5 transition-all hover:border-brand/35\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer items-center justify-between gap-4 font-semibold text-[14.5px] [&amp;::-webkit-details-marker]:hidden\"><span>Common questions</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down h-4 w-4 shrink-0 text-muted-foreground transition-transform group-open:rotate-180\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></summary><div class=\"faq-answer\"><div class=\"mt-3 space-y-3\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/60 px-3.5 py-3\"><p class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold\">Do I need to sync the catalog myself?</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">The first command that needs the catalog downloads it; later runs refresh it in the background at most every 6 hours. Set LITESPM_NO_AUTO_SYNC=1 (or run under CI) to turn that off. litespm catalog sync still works on demand. On npm v0.6.0, background auto-sync is active.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/60 px-3.5 py-3\"><p class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold\">Why do some listings say Discovery only?</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">A server needs a remote endpoint or a publisher-declared command with arguments. If a listing has only a repository link, LiteSPM will not guess whether to run it with npx, python or uvx. The detail page links only to the source the catalog recorded.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/60 px-3.5 py-3\"><p class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold\">How do installs protect my config?</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">LiteSPM splices JSON/JSONC and TOML by byte offset, so comments and key order survive. Use dry-run to inspect a plan. Managed removal reconciles tracked entries and preserves conflicting edits.</p></div><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/60 px-3.5 py-3\"><p class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold\">Can I install from inside my agent?</p><p class=\"mt-1 text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Selected integrations offer marketplace commands. Pi and OpenCode have tested interactive workflows; Copilot CLI has a tested select flow. Check compatibility for other hosts. npm v0.6.0.</p></div><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"View all documentation and troubleshooting guides\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-[12.5px] font-medium text-brand hover:underline\">All docs and troubleshooting <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></button></div></div></details></div></div></section><section class=\"border-t border-border/60 bg-muted/10\" aria-labelledby=\"compare-title\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"max-w-[64ch]\"><p class=\"text-[11px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-brand\">How LiteSPM compares</p><h2 id=\"compare-title\" class=\"mt-1 text-[24px] font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-[28px]\">Built for config safety, not just discovery.</h2></div><div class=\"mt-6 overflow-x-auto rounded-2xl border border-border/70 bg-card\"><table class=\"w-full min-w-[640px] border-collapse text-left text-[13px]\"><thead><tr class=\"border-b border-border/70 bg-muted/30 text-[11.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground\"><th class=\"px-4 py-3\">Capability</th><th class=\"px-4 py-3 text-brand\">LiteSPM</th><th class=\"px-4 py-3\">Manual JSON / TOML</th><th class=\"px-4 py-3\">npx skills</th><th class=\"px-4 py-3\">Docker MCP</th></tr></thead><tbody class=\"divide-y divide-border/50\"><tr class=\"hover:bg-muted/20\"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 font-medium text-foreground\">MCP servers + Skills + Plugins</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 font-medium text-brand\">Unified (52 hosts / 81 skill targets)</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground\">Manual per-host edits</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground\">Skills only</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground\">MCP containers only</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-muted/20\"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 font-medium text-foreground\">Pre-write diff &amp; approval gate</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 font-medium text-brand\">Always previews diff before write</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground\">None</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground\">Minimal prompt</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground\">Container runtime</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-muted/20\"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 font-medium text-foreground\">Byte-exact SHA-256 rollback</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 font-medium text-brand\">litespm restore &lt;slug&gt; (preserves comments)</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground\">Manual undo</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground\">No config rollback</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground\">N/A</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-muted/20\"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 font-medium text-foreground\">Agent-to-agent config porting</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 font-medium text-brand\">litespm copy --from A --to B (strips secrets)</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground\">Copy-paste &amp; reformat</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground\">No MCP config port</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground\">N/A</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-muted/20\"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 font-medium text-foreground\">Reproducible lockfile &amp; SBOM</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 font-medium text-brand\">litespm lock --check &amp; CycloneDX/SPDX</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground\">None</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground\">Partial lock</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground\">Image digests only</td></tr><tr class=\"hover:bg-muted/20\"><td class=\"px-4 py-3 font-medium text-foreground\">Zero-runtime overhead</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 font-medium text-brand\">Native CLI + stdio bridge (no Docker)</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground\">Zero overhead</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground\">Node.js required</td><td class=\"px-4 py-3 text-muted-foreground\">Requires Docker Desktop</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></section><section class=\"border-t border-border/60\"><div class=\"mx-auto flex max-w-6xl flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-6 px-4 py-12 sm:px-6\"><div><p class=\"text-[11.5px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-brand\">Ready when you are</p><h2 class=\"mt-1.5 text-[24px] font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-[27px]\">Point your agent at the whole catalog.</h2><p class=\"mt-1.5 max-w-[54ch] text-[13.5px] text-muted-foreground\">Install LiteSPM once and <span class=\"font-mono text-[12.5px]\">/litespm-marketplace</span> <!-- -->inside a connected agent reaches the same catalog through the bridge.</p></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-3\"><div class=\"flex items-stretch overflow-hidden rounded-lg border border-border/70 bg-[oklch(0.16_0.01_163)] w-[320px]\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 border-r border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] px-3 font-mono text-[10px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-brand\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-terminal h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 19h8\"></path><path d=\"m4 17 6-6-6-6\"></path></svg>npm</span><code class=\"min-w-0 flex-1 overflow-x-auto whitespace-nowrap no-scrollbar px-3.5 py-2.5 font-mono text-[11.5px] sm:text-[12.5px] text-[oklch(0.93_0.01_163)]\" title=\"npm install -g litespm\">npm install -g litespm</code><button type=\"button\" aria-label=\"Copy install command\" class=\"shrink-0 border-l border-white/10 bg-white/[0.04] px-3.5 text-[11.5px] font-medium text-white/70 transition-colors hover:bg-brand/15 hover:text-brand\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-copy h-3.5 w-3.5\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"14\" x=\"8\" y=\"8\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg></button></div><div class=\"flex gap-2\"><button data-slot=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive border bg-background shadow-xs hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground dark:bg-input/30 dark:border-input dark:hover:bg-input/52 py-2 has-[&gt;svg]:px-3 h-10 flex-1 rounded-xl px-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-package h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M11 21.73a2 2 0 0 0 2 0l7-4A2 2 0 0 0 21 16V8a2 2 0 0 0-1-1.73l-7-4a2 2 0 0 0-2 0l-7 4A2 2 0 0 0 3 8v8a2 2 0 0 0 1 1.73z\"></path><path d=\"M12 22V12\"></path><polyline points=\"3.29 7 12 12 20.71 7\"></polyline><path d=\"m7.5 4.27 9 5.15\"></path></svg> Quickstart</button><button data-slot=\"button\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium transition-all disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg:not([class*=&#x27;size-&#x27;])]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 outline-none focus-visible:border-ring focus-visible:ring-ring/50 focus-visible:ring-[3px] aria-invalid:ring-destructive/20 dark:aria-invalid:ring-destructive/40 aria-invalid:border-destructive border bg-background shadow-xs hover:bg-accent hover:text-accent-foreground dark:bg-input/30 dark:border-input dark:hover:bg-input/52 py-2 has-[&gt;svg]:px-3 h-10 flex-1 rounded-xl px-4\">Browse bundles <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></section></div></main><footer class=\"mt-auto border-t border-border/60 bg-card/40\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-6xl px-4 py-14 sm:px-6\"><div class=\"grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2 md:gap-10 md:grid-cols-[1.5fr_repeat(4,1fr)]\"><div class=\"sm:col-span-2 md:col-span-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"text-brand\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M12 2.5 20.5 7v10L12 21.5 3.5 17V7L12 2.5Z\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"></path><path d=\"M3.5 7 12 11.7 20.5 7M12 11.7v9.8\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" opacity=\"0.55\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"11.7\" r=\"1.6\" fill=\"currentColor\"></circle></svg></span><span class=\"text-[15px] font-semibold tracking-tight\">LiteSPM</span></div><p class=\"mt-3 max-w-[40ch] text-[12.5px] leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">The package manager for AI agents. Find MCP servers, skills and plugins once, and install them into every coding agent you use — with preview, backup and undo.</p><div class=\"mt-4 flex items-center gap-3\"><a href=\"https://github.com/sarv-projects/LiteSPM\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" aria-label=\"LiteSPM on GitHub\" class=\"inline-flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-border/70 text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:border-brand/40 hover:text-brand\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-github h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><pat